var dayData_0801={"date":"2026-08-01","dateDisplay":"📅 2026年8月1日 星期六","meta":"自动化 ID: 9-30-am · 第4期 · 正式运行","html":"<div class=\"section-title\">📋 今日计划列表</div><table class=\"plan-table\"><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>计划项</th><th>状态</th><th>进展</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>研究 <a href=\"https://supabase.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#667eea\">Supabase</a></td><td><span class=\"status-emoji\">🔄</span> 进行中</td><td>第4期：架构全景梳理，Supabase MCP 与 AI 集成方向</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>探索好用的 Codex Skill</td><td><span class=\"status-emoji\">🔄</span> 进行中</td><td>第4期：探索 linear / pdf / transcribe</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"section-title\">🔷 Supabase 研究进展（第4期）</div><div class=\"supabase-stats\"><span class=\"stat-badge\">⭐ 107,328 Stars (+58)</span><span class=\"stat-badge\">🍴 13,374 Forks</span><span class=\"stat-badge\">👁 734 Watchers</span><span class=\"stat-badge\">🐛 1,166 Open Issues (-10)</span><span class=\"stat-badge\">🕐 今日活跃更新</span></div><div class=\"info-grid\"><div class=\"info-card\"><div class=\"label\">架构全景</div><div class=\"value\">客户端 SDK(supabase-js) → PostgresDB + Auth(JWT) → RLS策略 → Edge Functions(Deno) → Realtime(CDC/WebSocket) → Storage(CDN) → Vector(pgvector)。全链路从客户端到数据库一站式。</div></div><div class=\"info-card\"><div class=\"label\">Supabase MCP</div><div class=\"value\">社区已有 Supabase MCP Server，支持通过 AI 助手直接管理表结构、RLS 策略、最佳实践建议。Discord 社区用户反馈正面：\"their MCP is awesome\"。</div></div><div class=\"info-card\"><div class=\"label\">AI 集成方向</div><div class=\"value\">pgvector + OpenAI/HuggingFace = RAG 一站式方案。Edge Functions 可承载 AI 推理中间层。Supabase Advisors 自动建议安全与性能优化。</div></div><div class=\"info-card\"><div class=\"label\">社区案例</div><div class=\"value\">Firecrawl(从Pinecone迁移) · Rally(金融科技3月上线) · Hyper(AI营销平台) · E2B(AI代码执行) · Mobbin(20万用户从Firebase迁移)</div></div><div class=\"info-card\"><div class=\"label\">定价回顾</div><div class=\"value\">Free $0(500MB) · Pro $25(8GB) · Team $599(SSO/SOC2) · Enterprise(联系)。计算加购 Micro $10 ~ 16XL $3,730/月</div></div><div class=\"info-card\"><div class=\"label\">第4期小结</div><div class=\"value\">Supabase 已从\"BaaS工具\"进化为\"AI-ready 开发平台\"。pgvector + MCP + Edge Functions 三件套使其成为 RAG/AI 应用的理想后端。对 Java 后端开发者，SQL 原生 + 开源可自部署是核心吸引力。</div></div></div><div class=\"section-title\">🧩 Skill 推荐卡片（第4期）</div><div class=\"skill-grid\"><div class=\"skill-card\"><div class=\"skill-name\">📊 linear</div><div class=\"skill-source\">来源: <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/linear\" target=\"_blank\">openai/skills/.curated/linear</a> · 底层: <a href=\"https://github.com/linear/linear\" target=\"_blank\">linear/linear SDK</a></div><div class=\"skill-desc\">管理 Linear 中的 issues、projects 和团队工作流。支持读取、创建和更新 tickets。</div><div class=\"skill-stats\"><span class=\"skill-stat\">⭐ 1.5K (SDK仓库)</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">🍴 277 Forks</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">👁 21 Watchers</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">📦 openai/skills 24.4K</span></div><div class=\"skill-feedback\">💬 社区评价：Linear 是增长最快的项目管理工具之一，以速度和开发者体验著称。此 Skill 让 Codex 能直接操作 Linear tickets，适合用 Linear 管理任务的团队。SDK 仓库 1.5K Stars 反映社区活跃度。</div><div class=\"skill-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</span><span class=\"label\">4/5 推荐</span></div><a class=\"install-link\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/linear\" target=\"_blank\">查看详情 →</a></div><div class=\"skill-card\"><div class=\"skill-name\">📄 pdf</div><div class=\"skill-source\">来源: <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/pdf\" target=\"_blank\">openai/skills/.curated/pdf</a></div><div class=\"skill-desc\">读取、创建和审阅 PDF 文件。使用 Poppler 渲染页面做视觉检查，Python 工具(reportlab/pdfplumber/pypdf)进行生成和提取。</div><div class=\"skill-stats\"><span class=\"skill-stat\">📦 openai/skills</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">⭐ 24.4K (仓库)</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">🍴 1.7K Forks</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">👁 134 Watchers</span></div><div class=\"skill-feedback\">💬 社区评价：PDF 处理是企业开发中的高频需求。此 Skill 整合了渲染+提取+生成全链路工具，Poppler 视觉检查确保布局正确。对需要生成报表/合同/文档的后端场景极有价值。</div><div class=\"skill-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</span><span class=\"label\">4/5 推荐</span></div><a class=\"install-link\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/pdf\" target=\"_blank\">查看详情 →</a></div><div class=\"skill-card\"><div class=\"skill-name\">🎙️ transcribe</div><div class=\"skill-source\">来源: <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/transcribe\" target=\"_blank\">openai/skills/.curated/transcribe</a></div><div class=\"skill-desc\">音频转文字，支持说话人分离(diarization)和已知说话人提示。适用于会议录音、访谈、视频字幕提取。</div><div class=\"skill-stats\"><span class=\"skill-stat\">📦 openai/skills</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">⭐ 24.4K (仓库)</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">🍴 1.7K Forks</span><span class=\"skill-stat\">👁 134 Watchers</span></div><div class=\"skill-feedback\">💬 社区评价：音频转文字是会议纪要和内容创作的关键能力。支持说话人分离是亮点，可自动区分不同发言人。对经常开会的团队实用，可配合会议纪要工作流使用。</div><div class=\"skill-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</span><span class=\"label\">4/5 推荐</span></div><a class=\"install-link\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/transcribe\" target=\"_blank\">查看详情 →</a></div></div><div class=\"section-title\">🔮 明日展望</div><div class=\"tomorrow\"><div class=\"t-title\">明日方向</div>• <strong>Supabase</strong>：建议创建 Free 项目实操，或研究 Supabase MCP Server 接入方式<br>• <strong>Skill 探索</strong>：候选 screenshot、cloudflare-deploy、vercel-deploy、render-deploy<br>• <strong>已探索汇总(12个)</strong>：playwright⭐5 / sentry⭐4 / security-best-practices⭐4 / figma-implement-design⭐5 / notion-meeting-intelligence⭐4 / yeet⭐4 / define-goal⭐4 / gh-fix-ci⭐4 / cli-creator⭐5 / linear⭐4 / pdf⭐4 / transcribe⭐4<br>• <strong>计划列表</strong>：随时可新增项目</div>"};
